   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "La forma ber-...-an",
    "@en": "The Ber-..."
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "En algunas palabras, la base se repite y recibe **ber-** al principio y **-an** al final: **kejar → berkejar-kejaran**. A menudo expresa una acción mutua o compartida; el sentido depende de cada palabra.",
     "@en": "In some words, the base is repeated and received by **ber-** at the beginning and **-an** at the end: **kejar → berkejar-kejaran**. It often expresses a mutual or shared action; meaning depends on each word."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Acciones entre varias personas",
    "@en": "Actions between several persons"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Bersalam-salaman** es saludarse estrechando las manos; **berpeluk-pelukan**, abrazarse; **bersahut-sahutan**, responderse o llamarse unos a otros.",
     "@en": "**Bersalam-salaman** is to greet by shaking hands; **berpeluk-pelukan**, to embrace; **bersahut-sahutan**, to respond or to call each other."
    }
   ]
  },
